Since both $M, N\in [X^{1/3}, X^{2/3}]$, without the loss of generality we can assume $N\leq M$ and apply condition \ref{Type II} with $\alpha_2=\Lambda_{>X^{1/3}}$ and $\alpha_3= \mu_{>X^{1/3}}*1$ to obtain
