 \sum_{\substack{d\leq D\\(d,bc)=1}}\xi(d)\sum_{\substack{n<X\\n \equiv c \imod d\\(n, b)=1}}\Lambda(n)e(n\theta)\ll_{b, \delta}  X\bigg(\dfrac{(qH)^{\delta/2}}{X^{\delta/2}} + \dfrac{1}{(qH)^{\delta/2}}\bigg)(\log X)^{C_3}.
